# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Everything the host tests build or write (test binaries, their .dSYM bundles, .out / .pcap / .expert, out/*.ppm)
# is ignored: only sources, scripts, the Makefile and the sim/ and stubs/ trees are tracked. A new test needs no entry here.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Makefile
!/*.c
!/*.h
!/sim/
!/stubs/
!/*.sh
!/md380_stub/
